abstract: >-
  An MIT-licensed, local-first, zero-telemetry open-source AI safety and cognitive
  pacing toolkit combining an AI Boundary Degradation and Epistemic Loop Scanner,
  a 64-mode Hilbert Coherence Corridor telemetry engine, an 8x8 transition-matrix
  loop dampener, a 150-300 ms cognitive pacing buffer, an offline 45 Hz WebAudio
  grounding instrument, and a Python Model Context Protocol (MCP) UI server.
